team_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179099779", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993457826", "personaname": "A7K", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Apocalypse7000/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 32064, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 143, "playtime_at_review": 11155, "last_played": 1788653154, "avatar": "a49c5b24e2db7cbbcd5e78a36ea6d965867510fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played it a little bit, okay game.", "timestamp_created": 1731714800, "timestamp_updated": 1731714800, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179099655", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118411663", "personaname": "nika.mishina", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118411663/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1089, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1041, "last_played": 1732217452, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is repetitive and boring for me. And lacks content.  In the campaign you can not specialise - so the entire story has to be played as a generic spacemarine with the same ultimate. A lot of guns have very small difference from each other. You don't feel that you are using a bolter - more like a lasgan. You do not wreck havoc as a Death Angel of the Emperor - you always try to survive. \r\nThe story is hell short, no way to play as a dreadnout , no way to use a tank or a ThunderHawk, no turrets, no hides/covers. No tactics and at the same time no fun from rushing.", "timestamp_created": 1731714647, "timestamp_updated": 1731714647, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475319921970367432", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1732062344, "developer_response": "Hello nika.mishina,\n\nThank you for the feedback! The comments from our player base are always welcome and taken into consideration for the future of the game, and this time won't be any different.\n\nRegards,\nFocus Support Team", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179098704", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049649858", "personaname": "GhostN9", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049649858/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 151, "playtime_forever": 1871, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1266, "last_played": 1772591108, "avatar": "458822723832ee310d069c2678adc7990890eb5a"}, "language": "english", "review": "My 5th Warhammer 40K game after boltgun, fire warrior, space marines 1 and Darktide.\n\nThis game is a 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1731713586, "timestamp_updated": 1731773358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179097468", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972356525", "personaname": "Xylospongium", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972356525/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 5401, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 105, "playtime_at_review": 4855, "last_played": 1788849032, "avatar": "be6f4690ab3012beb8cdd6230a3db004c3f3001a"}, "language": "english", "review": "The campaign was a lot of fun but PvP is really lacking. Super limited selection of maps, lots of non-viable load outs so you only really see the same things over and over. \n\nFrustrating encounters. Assault, while weak, has a really un-fun loop of Jump pack > Dive attack > jump pack > dive attack. This is super hard to counter and almost always nets the assault player a kill if your teammates aren't bailing you out. \n\nPeople rolling everywhere. Turns space marines into rolly polly's with grimdark aesthetic. \n\nLots of useless loadout options. Like CoD you'll see everyone with the same loadouts in each respective class. \n\nOnce you get competent at PvP the game gets really stale as you'll yearn to play one of the other classes only to find its not as viable as the top few and so you'll just play the same thing, forever.", "timestamp_created": 1731712270, "timestamp_updated": 1733281737, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504373669624328613", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1731963330, "developer_response": "Hello Xylospongium,\n\nThank you for the comments! We are always listening to our player base in order to improve the game, and this time won't be any different.\n\nThe Emperor Protects.", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "179097341", "author": {"steamid": "76561199378926286", "personaname": "ThyrsoidSpace21", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199378926286/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2949, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2668, "last_played": 1768221163, "avatar": "56e077cd4bfd44b8a5ec7e68b16f0369674fd5cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "P", "timestamp_created": 1731712144, "timestamp_updated": 1731712144, "voted_up": tru